questions.stem:
A fintech lending company disburses digital loans of ₦1 million to ₦20 million to Nigerian SMEs. It wishes to offer credit life insurance seamlessly embedded in its loan origination platform to comply with NIIRA 2025's mandatory credit life obligation. Describe:
(a) the key product design features required;
(b) the API integration mechanics between the fintech and the life insurer;
(c) the disclosure obligations to the borrower; and (d) the regulatory requirements for the insurer to be eligible to write this business.
